---
# A caption comes first; then Alice speaks from off panel, beside a relation that is not hers.
cast:
  ALICE: {reference: alice, at: left_third}
  BOB: {reference: bob}
  CAROL: {reference: alice, at: right_third}
staging: [ALICE left_of BOB, BOB left_of CAROL]
---
PANEL 1
CAPTION: Later.

ALICE (OP)
Anyone?

BOB
Here.

CAROL
And here.
